  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Z2BN6Y6/banner.png\" alt=\"模组横幅 - Genshin Instruments\" width=\"1000\" border=\"0\" /></p><center>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><h2 style=\"font-size: 24px;\">将《原神》系列乐器添加到你的 Minecraft 体验中，并使用熟悉的按键绑定演奏你喜爱的歌曲！</h2></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">想要<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/evenmoreinstruments\">更多的乐器</a>吗？👀<br /></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">（刚接触演奏？来看看<a title=\"如何精通原神竖琴\" href=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/blog/how-to-master-the-lyre-genshin-instruments-mod/\">这个不错的教程</a>）</span></p></center>\n<!--<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Join the Development Livestream!</strong></h1>\n<p><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/YOqkeE_30Ik?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></p><hr/>-->\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_m7oIwfqpPI\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n  <br/>\n    <br/>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1>完整 MIDI 支持！</h1>\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/WaCIP4lWEzk\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7PKk7qorFTk\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/IMJbt353j9o\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 18px;\">本模组为游戏添加了以下乐器：</span></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>风神琴</strong> [立体声支持]</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>流云之琴</strong> [旧版 &amp; 新版]</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>旅行者之琴</strong> [音量归一化支持]</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>荒泷一斗的华丽大鼓</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>夜风号角</strong> [可持续使用]</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">乐器重新贴图由超棒的 Gen 制作 (<a href=\"https://github.com/StavWasPlayZ/Genshin-Instruments/issues/9\">#9</a>)！去看看他们的作品并支持一下吧 😋<br />\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/GenMode\">Modrinth</a> | <a href=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/member/gen/\">PlanetMinecraft</a> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/GenMedia\">Patreon</a> | <a title=\"@DatapackGen\" href=\"https://twitter.com/DatapackGen\">Twitter</a></span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 14px;\"><br /><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">支持功能：</span></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">每个乐器均可自定义音高</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可通过左/右 Shift（按你的按键绑定设置）调整移调</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">多套音符标签（键盘标签可匹配你的语言与布局）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">支持多人游戏和共享乐器界面！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n  <h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>⚠️ 重要 ⚠️：模组作者已停止维护该项目</strong></h2>\n<p>观看下方视频了解更多：</p>\n<p><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/TUzdklT4vcs?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>  \n<h1>内容展示</h1>\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1CVVqa2BHVE\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/bCLnB21RSj4\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/lzwnBKp6Pg0\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Gvs3MRvkJR4\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\n<p>（上方视频由 <a href=\"https://github.com/k5md/M2KB\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">M2KB</a> 项目提供支持）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr /><center>\n<p><h3><strong>你是内容创作者吗？还是乐器演奏者？</strong></h3></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">请通过 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/private-messages/send?recipient=stavwasplays\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CurseForge 私信</a> 联系我，让你的视频在<strong>这里</strong>展示！</span></p>\n</center><hr />\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 18px;\"><strong>合成配方</strong></span></h2>\n<p><strong>风神琴<br></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fMDz9ul.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"190\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong>旅行者之琴</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Dtbc6lk.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"190\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong>流云之琴</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cMR8lkA.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"190\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong>荒泷一斗的华丽大鼓</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/165Cjnf.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"190\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong>夜风号角<br></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bY07PUc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"190\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><b>本项目与米哈游（HoYoverse）及《原神》无任何关联。</b></span><br>\n所有音频素材与设计元素均归该公司所有。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br />这个项目最初只是一个小型的学习测试项目，如今却成为了我的首个正式发布作品。作为一名普通的 Minecraft 与《原神》爱好者，能和大家分享它我感到无比激动和开心 :^)</p>",
